        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Beyond the Box for Higher Education Act of 2026</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Department of Education to issue guidance and recommendations for institutions of higher education to remove criminal and juvenile justice questions from their admission applications.</p>]]></text>
